s aware of calls for Clinton's electors to support someone like John Kasich or Mitt Romney in order to entice those 37 Republican electors away from Trump, but that he assumed Clinton's electors were going to vote for her. NEWLINE_CHAR NEWLINE_CHAR \"It's not really what the Democrats are going to do. And I guess we'll know about it tomorrow,\" Podesta said.\n",
